<title>AUSTRALIA: Breakwater Trust posts A$5 mln yr net loss.</title>
<headline>Breakwater Trust posts A$5 mln yr net loss.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		  (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    2.03  vs   3.02</p>
<p>    Net			     loss  5.03  vs   3.11</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    nil   vs   1.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    nil   vs   1.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  43.90  vs  50.59</p>
<p>    Other income			  0.18  vs   0.30</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		   loss  3.5   vs   2.2</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		loss  6.31  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.75  vs   0.09 benefit</p>
<p>    Interest				1.10  vs   1.83</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  2.35  vs   2.45</p>
<p>    Minorities			    nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Breakwater Island Trust operates the Townsville casino in north Queensland. The abnormal loss includes a A$6.77 million writedown in the value of property, plant and equipment.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
